">Makefile</a>
</p>

<h3>VirusTotal Results</h3>

<p>Scanning the 133 byte PE file that downloads a DLL over WebDAV with comm=
on anti-virus
software shows that the rate of detection is very low. My suggestion to AV =
vendors is to
start using the presense of UNC imports as a malware heuristic.</p>

